cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: >-
  equiparity: code and measurement records for "A single design choice determines
  whether machine learning models of materials make physically impossible
  predictions"
abstract: >-
  Matched-pair model builders and a parity verification gate for equivariant
  machine-learned models of materials. Each core is built twice from one typed
  configuration, differing only in whether its features carry parity labels, so
  the parity gap is measured rather than inferred. Ships the frozen measurement
  records and two checkers that re-derive every reported quantity from them.
type: software
